WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,780 --> 00:00:03,940
What's going on? It's 2:01

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,420
Why haven't you entered the copy yet?

3
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:07,740
Old players should be pulled into the dungeon first

4
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:09,880
Are there other veteran players here?

5
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:12,040
Could it be that the copy was maxed out and closed?

6
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:14,680
If the copy changes then refresh time

7
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:16,120
Will there also be deviations?

8
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,320
What nonsense are you talking about?

9
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:19,240
Do you really believe the deputy captain’s nonsense?

10
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:28,260
Not an ordinary copy at all

11
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:30,260
He has really become a mid- to high-level dungeon

12
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:32,020
It'll start in a while

13
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:33,380
I will go directly to ambush the Rou family.

14
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:35,170
Scared this bitch to death

15
00:00:35,330 --> 00:00:42,240
You must be kidding me because I didn't sleep well last night.

16
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:44,840
Who locked us up? I won’t play anymore and I want to file a complaint against you.

17
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:49,280
I don't want to play anymore. Let me out now.

18
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:51,740
What kind of pretense is this that is so scary?

19
00:00:51,740 --> 00:00:52,980
I will definitely complain to you when I go out

20
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:54,620
The patient is tempted to eat if he wants to prove it

21
00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:55,900
It seems that I took too little medicine

22
00:00:56,180 --> 00:00:58,780
I'm going to give you medicine right now. Why don't you stop?
